    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say it gets better, but it doesnt feel like it. it feels like i was two halves of one person, and now i'm just the half that's left behind. it's not even sadness anymore, it’s just... nothingness. like there's no point to any of this. how am i supposed to just \"heal\" from being completely gone?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
